    <string name="cue_eairh_sol_3">Lay your baby on their tummy and rubbing their back also helps</string>
    <string name="cue_eairh_sol_4">Massage your baby’s tummy to help move the air bubbles</string>
    <string name="cue_eairh_sol_5">Always burp your baby when they make the “Eh” sound to stop the air bubbles from moving lower</string>
    <string name="cue_eairh_sol_6">Never put your baby to sleep while they are making the "Eairh" sound</string>
